{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 57.14,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写协议的人，把偿付不变量写成一条公式，再用不变量测试去验证它。",
   "spoken": "写协议的人，把偿付不变量写成一条公式，再用不变量测试去验证它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 4.62,
   "speechEnd": 10.055
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "审计的人，列出每一个改变抵押品和债务的入口，逐个核对有没有健康检查。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，列出每一个改变抵押品和债务的入口，逐个核对有没有健康检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 10.44,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 10.44,
   "speechEnd": 16.794
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "普通用户，收益来源说不清楚的产品，不要投入大额。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，收益来源说不清楚的产品，不要投入大额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 17.22,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 17.22,
   "speechEnd": 21.391
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "稳定币也不是无风险资产。先查它的储备，赎回规则，和发行方的冻结权限。",
   "spoken": "稳定币也不是无风险资产。先查它的储备，赎回规则，和发行方的冻结权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 21.84,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 21.84,
   "speechEnd": 28.116
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "回到开头。每个函数都没有错，协议为什么损失约 1.97 亿美元？",
   "spoken": "回到开头。每个函数都没有错，协议为什么损失约 1.97 亿美元？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 28.54,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 28.638,
   "speechEnd": 34.961
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "因为规则允许一条路径，减少抵押品，却不检查健康因子。",
   "spoken": "因为规则允许一条路径，减少抵押品，却不检查健康因子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 35.68,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 35.68,
   "speechEnd": 40.894
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "这个答案成立的前提是，清算折扣会随缺口变大，缺口才能变成利润。",
   "spoken": "这个答案成立的前提是，清算折扣会随缺口变大，缺口才能变成利润。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 41.34,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 41.44,
   "speechEnd": 47.361
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "代码没错，规则错了。规则的每一种组合，都要守住偿付不变量。",
   "spoken": "代码没错，规则错了。规则的每一种组合，都要守住偿付不变量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 47.8,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 47.891,
   "speechEnd": 53.294
  },
  {
